<p>The venue also hosted local performances, including the Mandan Music Club's annual Christmas program. Under owner {% person "frank-wetzstein" %}Frank Wetzstein{% endperson %}, the theater underwent a major renovation in 1935 that included a {% inflation 6000, 1935 %} air-conditioning system. The equipment held the auditorium at 70°F on the hottest summer days and replaced its entire air supply every minute.</p>

