<p>The theater building also housed the Palace of Sweets, a confectionery selling candy, fruit, cigars, and magazines. {% person "frank-crisafulli" %}Frank Crisafulli{% endperson %} owned the shop.</p>

<p>The final film shown was <em>The Ten Commandments</em>, starring {% person "charlton-heston" %}Charlton Heston{% endperson %}, on October 27, 1957. The Palace continued hosting live events through 1961. It was demolished in 1978 to provide additional parking for the adjacent bank.</p>
